## 14. State Management

Все store реализованы через setup-style `defineStore()`.
Общий шаблон:

- `ref`/`reactive` для состояния;
- `computed` для derived state;
- async actions;
- единая error model;
- explicit loading/busy flags.

### 14.1. `auth-store`

`src/features/auth/model/auth-store.ts`

#### Responsibility

- backend health probing;
- session bootstrap;
- token lifecycle;
- current user hydration;
- login/register/reset flows;
- logout.

#### State

- `user`
- `sessionToken`
- `isInitializing`
- `isSubmitting`
- `isRecoveringPassword`
- `error`
- `backendHealth`

#### Derived State

- `isAuthenticated`
- `fieldErrors`
- `hasSession`

#### Critical Flow

`initialize()`:

1. `checkBackendHealth()`
2. `fetchCurrentUser()`
3. toggles `isInitializing`

Это делает store единственной точкой входа в auth bootstrap.

### 14.2. `dictionaries-store`

`src/features/dictionaries/model/dictionaries-store.ts`

#### Responsibility

Загрузка и хранение reference data:

- cities
- skills
- languages
- interaction types

#### Implementation Detail

`loadAll()` использует `Promise.all()`, что минимизирует cold-start latency словарного слоя.

### 14.3. `profiles-store`

`src/features/profile/model/profiles-store.ts`

#### Responsibility

