## 17. Cross-Feature Flows

### 17.1. App Initialization Flow

```text
main.ts
 -> App.vue mounted
 -> authStore.initialize()
 -> dictionariesStore.loadAll()
```

### 17.2. Session Restoration Flow

```text
authStore.initialize()
 -> tokenStorage.get()
 -> authApi.getCurrentUser()
 -> user hydration
 -> authenticated UI state
```

### 17.3. Login Flow

```text
AuthPage submit
 -> authStore.login()
 -> authApi.login()
 -> request("/auth/login")
 -> accessToken + user
 -> tokenStorage.set()
 -> store update
 -> route transition
```

### 17.4. Profile Save Flow

```text
ProfilePage
 -> profilesStore.saveStudentProfile() / saveMentorProfile()
 -> build DTO payload
 -> feature API call
 -> backend response
 -> form patch from persisted DTO
```

### 17.5. Mentor Request Creation Flow

```text
MentorsPage
 -> mentorDirectoryStore.searchMentors()
 -> mentor selection
 -> mentorDirectoryStore.submitRequest()
 -> mentoringApi.create()
```

### 17.6. Request Transition Flow

```text
RequestsPage
 -> requestsStore.openRequest()
 -> requestsStore.accept/clarify/reject/cancel/complete()
 -> runRequestAction()
 -> refresh active request + refresh list
```

### 17.7. Attachment-Backed Message Flow

```text
FilesPage
 -> filesStore.upload("chat-attachment")
 -> backend returns fileId

ChatPage
 -> form.attachmentFileId = fileId
 -> chatStore.sendMessage()
 -> POST /chats/{chatId}/messages
```

